item.description:
> *People gather in Rimmen's Sugar Bowl inn and tavern for discounted drinks, celebrating the end of a long day, or for some, the beginnings of a long night*

[Open social RP in Rimmen's tavern! The vibe is local and immersive, feel free to reach out for phasing or questions `@rosehead`]

@Elsweyr Ping

@Hammerfell Ping
*The warmth of Abah's Landing harkens! What tales will you tell? What rumors will you hear? What connections and friendships might you make? Find out as the city comes alive!*
> **Roleplayers Unlimited's** weekly Abah's Landing RP is starting in the courtyard of the **Hew's Mane tavern**! Feel free to stop by, or start your own RP scene in Abah's Landing! You can whisper ``@Nitewalker314`` for a port until <t:1794018600:t>. > -# Open vampires, werewolves, daedra, etc. should expect potentially hostile encounters in Abah's Landing.
